<title>PHILIPPINES: PHILIPPINE FIRM BUYS 27,000 TONNES U.S. WHEAT.</title>
<headline>PHILIPPINE FIRM BUYS 27,000 TONNES U.S. WHEAT.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine firm bought 27,000 tonnes U.S. wheat for shipment in the middle of this month, a trader involved in the deal said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;I bought at the lowest point early this week,&quot; the trader said, adding the transaction was closed Tuesday night.</p>
<p>--manila.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
